    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The darkest matrix ever created</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698830/extras/d36c2031bf7c7daa1fd25d355fa435fe.poster.avif?t=1749657835\" width=614 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698830/extras/d36c2031bf7c7daa1fd25d355fa435fe.webm?t=1749657835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698830/extras/d36c2031bf7c7daa1fd25d355fa435fe.mp4?t=1749657835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Dear Neighbor, edition 404</strong> is a survival horror puzzle game set in a distinct and captivating world. Players will find themselves immersed in a story rich with unique characters and a terrifying atmosphere. This game challenges players with moral decisions and reveals a brutally unforgiving world waiting to be discovered. As players navigate through this virtual realm, they will experience a hand-crafted universe filled with secrets and parallel dimensions to explore and unravel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>My Dear Neighbor, Edition 404</strong>, players are plunged into a bleak and terrifying universe, where they must seek answers within a matrix-like reality. The challenge lies in discerning truth from illusion and facing one's deepest fears. Players must fight to escape a nightmarish world riddled with bugs and harrowing visions in this intense psychological horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world unique in its kind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698830/extras/06001329209d4d34d628feb9b7a02099.avif?t=1749657835\" width=630 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Dear Neighbor, Edition 404</strong> transcends conventional visuals with its groundbreaking shaders that render objects distorted and seemingly unstable, imbuing the world with vibrant, vivid colors. This artistic choice gives the environment a hauntingly &quot;unfinished&quot; or &quot;glitched&quot; appearance, perfectly complementing the game's theme of a digital reality breaking down. It's a visual style that not only sets the game apart but also deepens the player's immersion in a world where the fabric of virtual existence is constantly in question</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An Original Story : Inspired by &quot;The Matrix&quot; and &quot;Code Lyoko&quot;, explore a unique world with diverse, meticulously designed environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Intense Combat : Fight your way through this world. As a player, you'll be equipped with weapons to defend yourself in challenging battles against unique characters and boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Impactful Choices : Make decisions that influence your gameplay experience and the game's ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A Narrative-Driven Horror : Immerse yourself in a terrifying game rich in plot twists and featuring a variety of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A Unique Artistic Direction: Every element is meticulously crafted to embody the essence of a digital realm, enhancing the game's immersive quality. The visual design leverages the theme of a virtual world, drawing players deeper into its unique, glitched reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698830/extras/86615ba6e3cc4d4f50ceec5de2a73e93.poster.avif?t=1749657835\" width=450 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698830/extras/86615ba6e3cc4d4f50ceec5de2a73e93.webm?t=1749657835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698830/extras/86615ba6e3cc4d4f50ceec5de2a73e93.mp4?t=1749657835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
